  "description": "Leave your troubles at home. Set off for a ride on the Overvolt AM. This electrically-assisted all-mountain bike is the ultimate machine for discovering, loving and adopting the mountains. Thanks to its solid heritage, it is immune to the constraints of the bumpy trails found in mountain resorts. At high altitude, its kinematics and handling border on enduro, with unique manoeuvrability and responsiveness. The Mullet design (27.5-inch rear wheel / 29-inch front wheel) adds another dimension to mountain adventures. It complements the 170 mm of travel provided by the RockShox ecosystem (fork and shock absorber), known for its reliability in every situation. By guaranteeing optimised grip on the rear triangle while retaining clearance on the front, this geometry contributes greatly to overall performance.",
